5ff690a9-77cb-49e5-9c4e-4ccc3ff387b3	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	1	\N	Fly Kathmandu to Lukla, trek to Phakding	Early mountain flight to Tenzing-Hillary Airport (2,860m). Meet the porter crew and drop 200m along the Dudh Koshi to Phakding (2,610m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
b6c5213a-5ff9-4228-9a5b-7bb514b35af3	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	2	\N	Phakding to Namche Bazaar	Cross five suspension bridges including the high Hillary Bridge, enter Sagarmatha National Park at Monjo, then climb steeply to Namche (3,440m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
fe63ca5f-3010-409a-8807-f89652e657ff	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	3	\N	Namche acclimatisation day	Hike to the Everest View Hotel (3,880m) for the first Everest panorama, then visit Khumjung village and the Sherpa Culture Museum. Sleep low at Namche.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
633a5ef6-0c33-4d9a-9c0f-aa39059b3b1a	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	4	\N	Namche to Tengboche	Contour the Dudh Koshi gorge to Phunki Thanga, then climb to Tengboche Monastery (3,860m) in time for the late-afternoon prayer ceremony.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
f7beee8d-6bd6-43c9-8af7-74606f036b32	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	5	\N	Tengboche to Dingboche	Through rhododendron forest to Pangboche, past the old gompa, then above the treeline into the Imja Valley at Dingboche (4,410m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
6b9d514e-9163-4594-b90e-6300cdb6d915	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	6	\N	Dingboche acclimatisation day	Ascend Nangkartshang Peak (5,083m) for views of Makalu, Lhotse and Ama Dablam, then descend to sleep at Dingboche.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
7cfa3aea-1587-4eae-b8de-7753c7a5fa48	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	7	\N	Dingboche to Lobuche	Climb to Thukla Pass and the Everest memorial chortens, then follow the Khumbu Glacier moraine to Lobuche (4,940m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
55bf9dc3-c86c-43d1-969c-d40c4eaa5ca0	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	8	\N	Lobuche to Everest Base Camp, sleep Gorak Shep	Cross the glacier moraine to Gorak Shep (5,164m), then walk out to Everest Base Camp (5,364m) beneath the Khumbu Icefall.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
76579744-fb6a-4dae-baa0-13e19e881b29	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	9	\N	Kala Patthar sunrise, descend to Pheriche	Pre-dawn climb of Kala Patthar (5,545m) for the classic Everest summit view, then a long descent to Pheriche (4,371m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
e45cad99-504e-4919-94be-753c9249056f	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	10	\N	Pheriche to Namche Bazaar	Retrace the Imja Valley through Pangboche and Tengboche, dropping back into thicker air at Namche.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
4b9976ab-c2aa-4f44-976d-9d4d9d24138f	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	11	\N	Namche to Lukla	Final long descent along the Dudh Koshi to Lukla, with a celebration dinner with the Sherpa crew.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
282e67c1-15a6-4ad8-9337-1a1143e69496	35436abd-4368-4c1c-a660-a85fde7686af	12	\N	Fly Lukla to Kathmandu	Morning flight back to Kathmandu before the valley winds build. Transfer to your hotel.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
6f3329e5-97d0-42a6-b124-10931e9d5629	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	1	\N	Drive Pokhara to Nayapul, trek to Ulleri	Road transfer to the trailhead at Nayapul, then the famous 3,300 stone steps up to Ulleri (2,070m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
cb247d12-61f6-4c04-be2b-ecd6833f5402	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	2	\N	Ulleri to Ghorepani	Climb through moss-hung rhododendron forest via Banthanti and Nangethanti to the ridge village of Ghorepani (2,874m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
9aabfbcc-c963-43f2-a206-77d8fb346d50	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	3	\N	Poon Hill sunrise, trek to Tadapani	Pre-dawn ascent of Poon Hill (3,210m) for Dhaulagiri and Annapurna South at first light, then traverse to Tadapani (2,630m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
c3ac51cd-ba5b-4955-893d-513537d2f921	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	4	\N	Tadapani to Chhomrong	Descend to Kimrong Khola and climb to Chhomrong (2,170m), the Gurung gateway village to the Annapurna Sanctuary.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
cfa0f6dc-cf46-4e39-a8d5-5a6a96bfeac9	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	5	\N	Chhomrong to Dovan	Drop to the Chhomrong Khola, climb to Sinuwa and enter the bamboo corridor of the sanctuary gorge to Dovan (2,600m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
15ff2b59-8241-4122-9db1-00bbe1ef738b	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	6	\N	Dovan to Deurali	Past the Hinku Cave and Himalaya Hotel, the valley narrows and opens above the treeline at Deurali (3,230m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
9d7e0e9d-e7dc-4c02-b2eb-38c1936b0d78	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	7	\N	Deurali to Annapurna Base Camp	Enter the sanctuary via Machhapuchhre Base Camp (3,700m) and continue into the amphitheatre at Annapurna Base Camp (4,130m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
f02d8d45-768c-459e-8a73-81e4267a8153	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	8	\N	ABC sunrise, descend to Bamboo	Watch the sun hit the Annapurna I face, then a long descent out of the sanctuary to Bamboo (2,310m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
2ec8838e-0009-4f11-a2b0-f83ecdf0aa5c	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	9	\N	Bamboo to Jhinu Danda hot springs	Back over the Chhomrong stair to Jhinu Danda (1,780m) and a soak in the riverside natural hot springs.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
1f28807d-00a3-4ed2-8769-f52e8e261b14	8a52986e-b802-499f-ac6d-a4ed570eb055	10	\N	Jhinu Danda to Nayapul, drive Pokhara	Easy riverside walk to the road head at Nayapul and a short drive back to Pokhara lakeside.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
bf44482e-b783-4e03-af83-93472892aca9	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	1	\N	Fly Kathmandu to Lukla, trek to Phakding	Mountain flight into Lukla (2,860m), then a gentle first walk down the Dudh Koshi valley to Phakding.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
f6bc08d9-f3ea-4990-8b38-24625a22112f	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	2	\N	Phakding to Namche Bazaar	Park entry at Monjo, the high Hillary Bridge crossing, then the long climb to Namche Bazaar (3,440m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
90662138-6577-4369-a14f-9649a6ae9a1f	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	3	\N	Namche acclimatisation day	Acclimatisation hike to Khunde and Khumjung, visiting the Hillary school and monastery, then back down to Namche to sleep.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
3f781d9c-7d66-4b5d-b803-257fdaddb035	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	4	\N	Namche to Dole	Leave the Base Camp trail at Sanasa and climb the quieter Gokyo branch via Mong La (3,975m) to Dole (4,040m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
b853d358-08d7-4b05-9df4-4f28552f738a	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	5	\N	Dole to Machhermo	Short acclimatisation stage along the Dudh Koshi headwaters beneath Kangtega and Thamserku to Machhermo (4,470m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
c79281e1-94db-4205-9dd7-f09e12a0ac02	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	6	\N	Machhermo to Gokyo	Pass the terminal moraine of the Ngozumpa Glacier and the first two lakes to reach Gokyo village on the third lake (4,790m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
8ea3f304-b3c3-4e64-ade7-94a3f861e61c	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	7	\N	Gokyo Ri summit and the fourth and fifth lakes	Dawn climb of Gokyo Ri (5,357m) for four 8,000m peaks in one panorama, then walk out to Thonak and Ngozumpa Tsho.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
97d92ec4-a936-4d9a-bece-ed15230ffd11	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	8	\N	Gokyo to Dole	Retrace the moraine trail past the turquoise lakes and drop back below the treeline at Dole.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
6fe66ba2-d779-4ca0-a345-cd2a1801aec6	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	9	\N	Dole to Namche Bazaar	Climb back over Mong La and rejoin the main Khumbu trail into Namche.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
ef85ab2c-4ca5-48b5-baa3-662c877285ff	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	10	\N	Namche to Lukla	Final descent along the Dudh Koshi with a farewell dinner with the crew in Lukla.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
dba147c7-7eb2-4c0e-b02a-41972ce2e25f	c20cdbb1-f3a4-4704-9785-516f3a5ef75d	11	\N	Fly Lukla to Kathmandu	Early morning flight back to Kathmandu ahead of the afternoon wind.	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
d49b1b8c-98dc-40fe-8ce9-fa77ecfcb76a	e2442f17-8ba3-4fd7-87c2-56f3f4fa81f2	1	\N	Drive Kathmandu to Machha Khola	Long road day via Dhading Besi and Arughat along the Budhi Gandaki to the trailhead at Machha Khola (930m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
1b30cc90-bb6b-451f-be7a-f756db833a33	e2442f17-8ba3-4fd7-87c2-56f3f4fa81f2	2	\N	Machha Khola to Jagat	Through the hot lower gorge past Khorlabesi hot springs and Tatopani, entering the restricted area at Jagat (1,340m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
