77af9156-922c-40b1-9b33-af1137de9c1a	e2442f17-8ba3-4fd7-87c2-56f3f4fa81f2	6	\N	Lho to Samagaun	Through Shyala with Manaslu, Himalchuli and Ganesh Himal encircling the valley, to the large Tibetan village of Samagaun (3,530m).	1	2026-08-07 16:15:41.955194+00
